rs and embedded software, Ceva provides the foundational IP for devices that connect, understand their environment, and act in real time. With more than 21 billion devices shipped and trusted by 400+ customers worldwide, Ceva is the backbone of today\u2019s most advanced smart edge products - from AI-infused wearables and IoT devices to autonomous vehicles and 5G infrastructure.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1173489/000143774926026648/ex_1001319.htm","filed":"2026-08-10","source":"8-K"},"da_v":2}